---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Run your rescue from one connected place" description="BarkHaus brings animal records, a branded rescue website, applications, and marketing tools together so your team can focus on helping animals find homes.">
  <Navbar currentPage="/" />
  <main>
    <section class="bh-hero">
      <div class="bh-container bh-hero-grid">
        <div class="bh-hero-copy">
          <p class="bh-kicker"><span class="bh-dot"></span> The home base for animal rescues</p>
          <h1>Run your rescue.<br /><em>Find more homes.</em></h1>
          <p class="bh-lead">Animal records, your website, applications, and marketing in one connected workspace. Spend less time moving information between tools and more time helping animals find their people.</p>
          <div class="bh-actions"><a class="bh-button bh-button-primary" href="/contact">Explore early access <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="bh-button bh-button-secondary" href="#how-it-works">See how BarkHaus works <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
          <p class="bh-hero-note">Built for animal rescues, shelters, and foster teams.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bh-hero-art" aria-label="Animal record connecting to a public listing and an application">
          <div class="bh-orbit bh-orbit-one"></div><div class="bh-orbit bh-orbit-two"></div>
          <div class="bh-record"><div class="bh-record-photo"><img src="/images/home-hero-header-section-0.jpg" alt="Happy rescue dog" width="640" height="480" fetchpriority="high" /></div><div class="bh-record-body"><span class="bh-mini-label">ANIMAL PROFILE</span><strong>Meet your next best friend</strong><span>Photos · Story · Care notes</span><span class="bh-status"><span></span> Ready for a home</span></div></div>
          <div class="bh-float bh-float-site"><span class="bh-float-icon">↗</span><div><small>PUBLIC WEBSITE</small><strong>Ready to discover</strong></div></div>
          <div class="bh-float bh-float-app"><span class="bh-float-icon">♡</span><div><small>APPLICATIONS</small><strong>A new connection</strong></div></div>
          <div class="bh-float bh-float-marketing"><span class="bh-float-icon">✳</span><div><small>MARKETING</small><strong>Story ready to share</strong></div></div>
          <div class="bh-hero-caption">ONE STORY, MORE WAYS TO CONNECT <span>01 / 04</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bh-intro" id="how-it-works"><div class="bh-container bh-intro-grid"><p class="bh-overline">THE IDEA IS SIMPLE</p><h2>Your rescue shouldn't need <em>eight tools</em> to tell one story.</h2><p>Animal details in a spreadsheet. Photos in a folder. Applications in an inbox. Website changes waiting on a volunteer. BarkHaus brings the work together so one update can support the next step.</p></div></section>

    <section class="bh-value"><div class="bh-container bh-value-grid"><div><p class="bh-overline">FEWER TOOLS. MORE TIME FOR RESCUE.</p><h2>One platform for the work you do every day.</h2><p>Bring animal management, your public website, forms, communications, and outreach into a shared workflow. BarkHaus is designed to replace the patchwork of 8+ separate tools many rescues piece together.</p><a class="bh-text-link" href="/features">Explore the platform <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="bh-value-list" aria-label="BarkHaus platform areas"><span>Animal records</span><span>Rescue website</span><span>Adoption applications</span><span>Foster forms</span><span>Volunteer forms</span><span>Community inbox</span><span>Marketing content</span><span>Organization branding</span></div></div></section>

    <section class="bh-journey"><div class="bh-container">
      <div class="bh-section-head"><div><p class="bh-overline">THE CONNECTED JOURNEY</p><h2>One place to start.<br /><em>More places to make an impact.</em></h2></div><p>Make the animal profile your starting point. The next steps can follow without losing the context behind them.</p></div>
      <div class="bh-journey-grid">
        <article><span class="bh-number">01 / RECORD</span><span class="bh-glyph" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><h3>Know every animal</h3><p>Keep photos, background, medical details, and availability together in a record your team can use.</p><a href="/features/animals">Animal management <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
        <article><span class="bh-number">02 / WEBSITE</span><span class="bh-glyph" aria-hidden="true">⌂</span><h3>Show their story</h3><p>Give adoptable animals a place on a rescue website that reflects your organization and is easy to update.</p><a href="/features/public-website">Public websites <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
        <article><span class="bh-number">03 / APPLICATIONS</span><span class="bh-glyph" aria-hidden="true">♡</span><h3>Follow the connection</h3><p>Bring adoption, foster, and volunteer interest into an organized review workflow.</p><a href="/features/applications">Applications <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
        <article><span class="bh-number">04 / OUTREACH</span><span class="bh-glyph" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><h3>Share what matters</h3><p>Use the information already in the record to prepare stories and updates for your community.</p><a href="/features/social-media">Outreach tools <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="bh-feature bh-feature-light"><div class="bh-container bh-feature-grid"><div class="bh-feature-visual"><img src="/images/barkhaus_dog_and_vet.png" alt="Veterinarian caring for a dog" loading="lazy" width="960" height="720" /><span class="bh-image-tag">THE WHOLE STORY, IN ONE PLACE</span></div><div class="bh-feature-copy"><p class="bh-overline">BUILT AROUND THE ANIMAL</p><h2>A record that goes beyond a name and a photo.</h2><p>Intake, care, photos, personality, and adoption status belong together. Your team gets the fuller picture and the details needed to keep public animal profiles accurate.</p><ul><li>Keep the details that help a match feel right</li><li>Organize the journey from intake to adoption</li><li>Give every team member a shared starting point</li></ul><a class="bh-text-link" href="/features/animals">Explore animal management <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>

    <section class="bh-feature bh-feature-cream" id="website-builder"><div class="bh-container bh-feature-grid bh-feature-reverse"><div class="bh-feature-visual"><div class="bh-site-preview"><div class="bh-browser-bar"><span></span><span></span><span></span><small>yourrescue.org</small></div><div class="bh-site-banner"><img src="/images/home-hero-header-section-0.jpg" alt="Dog featured on a rescue website" loading="lazy" /><div><small>WELCOME TO YOUR RESCUE</small><strong>Every animal deserves a home.</strong><span>Meet the animals waiting for their next chapter.</span></div></div><div class="bh-site-controls"><span>YOUR LOGO</span><span>YOUR COLORS</span><span>YOUR STORY</span></div></div><span class="bh-image-tag">A WEBSITE THAT FEELS LIKE YOUR RESCUE</span></div><div class="bh-feature-copy"><p class="bh-overline">WEBSITE BUILDER</p><h2>Give your rescue a home online, without starting from scratch.</h2><p>Bring your logo, colors, mission, and available animals together on a public site. Edit the content your community sees from one workspace, with a clear route from an animal profile to an application.</p><ul><li>Make the site your own with branding and page content</li><li>Showcase available animals and your mission</li><li>Keep the public story connected to rescue operations</li></ul><a class="bh-text-link" href="/features/public-website">Explore the website builder <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>

    <section class="bh-feature bh-feature-light" id="marketing-tools"><div class="bh-container bh-feature-grid"><div class="bh-feature-visual"><div class="bh-social-preview"><div class="bh-social-photo"><img src="/images/home-hero-header-section-0.jpg" alt="Dog portrait for an adoption post" loading="lazy" /></div><div class="bh-social-copy"><span class="bh-mini-label">SOCIAL POST DRAFT</span><strong>Meet your next best friend 🐾</strong><p>Start with the details in the animal profile. Shape the story in your rescue's voice, then share when it's ready.</p><div><span>Instagram</span><span>Facebook</span><span>More</span></div></div></div><span class="bh-image-tag">THEIR STORY, READY TO SHARE</span></div><div class="bh-feature-copy"><p class="bh-overline">MARKETING TOOLS</p><h2>Help more people meet the animals behind the profiles.</h2><p>Turn the information your team already has into a starting point for adoption posts and community updates. Choose a platform and tone, review the draft, and keep your rescue's voice in control.</p><ul><li>Draft content around an animal or a rescue update</li><li>Adapt the message for different channels</li><li>Copy and share through your own accounts</li></ul><a class="bh-text-link" href="/features/social-media">Explore marketing tools <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>

    <section class="bh-feature bh-feature-cream"><div class="bh-container bh-feature-grid bh-feature-reverse"><div class="bh-feature-visual"><img src="/images/barkhaus_dog_happy_family.png" alt="Family spending time with an adopted dog" loading="lazy" width="960" height="720" /><span class="bh-image-tag">FROM DISCOVERY TO A NEW HOME</span></div><div class="bh-feature-copy"><p class="bh-overline">ADOPTION & APPLICATIONS</p><h2>A better experience on both sides of the adoption.</h2><p>Give prospective adopters a clear path from an animal's page to an application. Give your rescue a place to review interest and keep the next steps moving.</p><a class="bh-text-link" href="/features/applications">Explore applications <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>

    <section class="bh-launch"><div class="bh-container bh-launch-grid"><div><p class="bh-overline">GET STARTED WITHOUT STARTING OVER</p><h2>Get your rescue online sooner. Get back to the work that matters.</h2><p>Set up your organization, bring in animal information, and shape a public site around your mission. We’re working with early rescue partners on the setup path, so your team can focus on care, connection, and finding homes.</p><a class="bh-button bh-button-primary" href="/contact">Talk about getting started ↗</a></div><ol><li><span>01</span><div><strong>Set up your rescue</strong><p>Add your name, story, branding, and the pages you need.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>Bring in your animals</strong><p>Build profiles with photos, details, care notes, and availability.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>Connect with your community</strong><p>Publish your site, receive interest, and prepare outreach from one place.</p></div></li></ol></div></section>

    <section class="bh-platform"><div class="bh-container bh-platform-grid"><div><p class="bh-overline">A PLATFORM THAT GROWS WITH YOU</p><h2>More room for the work behind every rescue.</h2></div><div class="bh-platform-links"><a href="/features/public-website"><span>01</span><strong>Website builder</strong><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/features/social-media"><span>02</span><strong>Marketing tools</strong><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/features/inbox"><span>03</span><strong>Community conversations</strong><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/features"><span>04</span><strong>Explore all capabilities</strong><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>

    <section class="bh-cta"><div class="bh-container bh-cta-inner"><div><p class="bh-overline">LET'S BUILD THE NEXT CHAPTER</p><h2>More time for the animals.<br /><em>Less time between tools.</em></h2><p>Tell us about your rescue and what would make your day easier. BarkHaus is in active development, and we'd love to hear from you.</p></div><a class="bh-button bh-button-light" href="/contact">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
